  m_Name: lenctenDialouge0
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - speakerName: Lencten
    text: "Merhaba. G\xF6r\xFCn\xFC\u015Fe g\xF6re ilk d\xF6ng\xFC seyehatine \xE7\u0131kmak
      \xFCzeresin.  "
  - speakerName: Lencten
    text: "\xC7ok konu\u015Fmay\u0131 seven birisi de\u011Filsin san\u0131r\u0131m..."
  - speakerName: Lencten
    text: "Ama unutma acele etmelisin e\u011Fer zaman\u0131nda bitirmezsen d\xFCnya
      sonsuza kadar sonbahar ya\u015Famaya mahkum kal\u0131r!\n"
